# The upstream receiver page is pinned by SHA-256, in this repo, in CI, and in
# the README. A checkout that rewrites line endings would break that promise on
# Windows (core.autocrlf is on here), so every text file is stored and checked
# out as LF regardless of the machine doing the clone.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.wasm binary
*.apk binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
